          "body": "> May be add a step on CI ?\n\nFirst add a \"skinny\" target, or something such as that, to CMake - and possibly additional targets for all the *other* XXX-specification-to-dissector translators we have, along the lines of the \"asn1\" target - so that people just have to know the name of the target, not all the steps to take to build the target, for generated dissectors.",
